# check 0x140469c30 rejects it for LAN sessions, so every LAN join ends with
# "session is no longer available". je -> jmp in that LAN-only branch accepts the host address.
# Steam build 2021-07-14: RVA 0x469c91. Online (Steam) joins use the other branch and are unaffected.
